  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e15-scene-17",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "全都是老大的逻辑  (Every Question in the Boss's Logic)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "On the eve of the Twelve Singers live finale, Bu Xiaogu hands Kaiwen and Xingzi a preparation sheet predicting every question Chun Yuqiao is about to ask. Listen to their Mandarin banter.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "现场流程已经盯过了，咱们不用管了，你们一人拿一份这个。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这是啥呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "还可以啊，老大会问的问题全都列出来了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "转播车检修这一项我绝对想不到，但他肯定会问。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "行啊小谷，来不到一年，比我们俩还了解老大了呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "而且这上面的顺序，全都是老大的逻辑。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "确实是这样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一会儿淳于总问的问题，谁答不上来，庆功宴就由谁请客。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那要是这单子上有任何纰漏怎么办？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我这个月的工资就不要了呗！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "成交，太优秀了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "现场流程已经盯过了，咱们不用管了，你们一人拿一份这个。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The stage rundown has already been checked; take one copy of this sheet each.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这是啥呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is this sheet?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "还可以啊，老大会问的问题全都列出来了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not bad at all—every question the boss is going to ask is listed right here!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "转播车检修这一项我绝对想不到，但他肯定会问。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I never would have thought of broadcast-truck maintenance, yet he will definitely ask about it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "行啊小谷，来不到一年，比我们俩还了解老大了呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Impressive, Xiaogu—here less than a year, and you already know the boss better than the two of us.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "而且这上面的顺序，全都是老大的逻辑。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even the sequence on this page follows the boss's exact logic.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "确实是这样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That really is true.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一会儿淳于总问的问题，谁答不上来，庆功宴就由谁请客。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In a bit, whoever cannot answer one of Chun Yuqiao's questions treats everyone at the wrap party.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那要是这单子上有任何纰漏怎么办？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And what if there is any oversight on this checklist of yours?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我这个月的工资就不要了呗！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then I will give up my salary for this whole month!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "成交，太优秀了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Deal—brilliant!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "现场流程已经盯过了，咱们不用管了，你们一人拿一份这个。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
