    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一会儿淳于总问的问题，谁答不上来，庆功宴就由谁请客。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那要是这单子上有任何纰漏怎么办？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我这个月的工资就不要了呗！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "成交，太优秀了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Amazed that Bu Xiaogu even anticipated broadcast-truck maintenance in Chun Yuqiao's exact order, Kaiwen and Xingzi seal a playful bet before he walks in. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
